<title>hong kong: TENNIS-THAILAND BEAT HONG KONG 5-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-THAILAND BEAT HONG KONG 5-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<text>
<p>HONG KONG, Feb 16, Reuter - Thailand won the doubles and the</p>
<p>two reverse singles on Sunday to complete a 5-0 victory over</p>
<p>Hong Kong in their Davis Cup Asia-Oceania zone group two first</p>
<p>round tie.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Thanakorn Srichaphan and Narathorn Srichaphan beat Graeme Foster</p>
<p>and Mark Ferreira 6-1 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Vittaya Samrej beat Ferreira 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Vorapol Thongkhamchoo beat Wayne Wong 6-3 7-6 (7-2)</p>
</text>
